# variation 1 of b10: the function of the aspect with its default and by name (D-133)
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#what-an-aspect-is
driver b10_test1 is
  process main is
    apply scale(0);
    apply scale(n: 7);
    apply scale(2, factor: 10);
  return;
end b10_test1;
